    - target: {fileID: 6014551766336674787, guid: 0cbc0856f0fb8d84a81be5dea463c369, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Welcome to the office! But oh no! Disaster has struck \u2014 an electrical
        fire has started on the first floor!\r\n\r\nIt seems someone overloaded a
        power socket with too many devices \u2014 coffee makers, microwaves, and
        phone chargers all fighting for attention. The wires couldn\u2019t handle
        it and sparked a fire.\r\n\r\nHint: This is an electrical fire \u2014 choose
        your fire extinguisher wisely! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
