    - target: {fileID: 6014551766336674787, guid: 0cbc0856f0fb8d84a81be5dea463c369, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "\"Got the right extinguisher? Great! Now let\u2019s put that fire out
        the right way. Follow these steps carefully!\"\r\n\r\n1\uFE0F\u20E3 Pull
        the Safety Pin\r\n\"That metal pin on top? It\u2019s there to prevent accidental
        discharge. Give it a firm pull \u2014 you're officially in firefighting mode!\"\r\n\r\n2\uFE0F\u20E3
        Aim at the Base of the Fire\r\n\"Fires don\u2019t just vanish when you spray
        the flames! Aim low, at the base where the fire is actually burning. This
        cuts off the oxygen and stops it from spreading.\"\r\n\r\n3\uFE0F\u20E3 Squeeze
        the Handle\r\n\"Now, slowly squeeze the lever to release the CO\u2082. Be
        ready \u2014 the nozzle gets extremely cold! Avoid touching it directly.\"\r\n\r\n4\uFE0F\u20E3
        Sweep from Side to Side\r\n\"Move the nozzle side to side over the base of
        the fire. This ensures full coverage and prevents reignition.\"\r\n\r\n5\uFE0F\u20E3
        Keep Spraying Until the Fire is Out\r\n\"Don't stop too soon! Keep spraying
        until the fire is completely gone. If it reignites, repeat the process.\"\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8747907324863920238, guid: 0cbc0856f0fb8d84a81be5dea463c369, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Color.b
      value: 0.042052314
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
